in="00:53.650" end="00:54.190">i'm </span><span begin="00:54.190" end="00:55.420">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.890" end="01:06.970"><span begin="00:56.890" end="00:57.070">When </span><span begin="00:57.070" end="00:57.280">the </span><span begin="00:57.280" end="00:59.800">two </span><span begin="00:59.800" end="01:00.340">hits </span><span begin="01:00.340" end="01:00.550">the </span><span begin="01:00.550" end="01:03.280">six </span><span begin="01:03.280" end="01:03.820">and </span><span begin="01:03.820" end="01:04.000">it's </span><span begin="01:04.000" end="01:06.970">summer</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.970" end="01:21.310"><span begin="01:06.970" end="01:07.690">Cloud </span><span begin="01:07.690" end="01:15.670">come </span><span begin="01:15.670" end="01:16.180">shove </span><span begin="01:16.180" end="01:18.550">the </span><span begin="01:18.550" end="01:19.570">sun </span><span begin="01:19.570" end="01:21.310">aside</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.610" end="01:27.850"><span begin="01:21.610" end="01:21.970">I </span><span begin="01:21.970" end="01:22.510">think </span><span begin="01:22.510" end="01:23.890">god </span><span begin="01:23.890" end="01:24.220">is </span><span begin="01:24.220" end="01:26.620">moving </span><span begin="01:26.620" end="01:27.550">its </span><span begin="01:27.550" end="01:27.850">tongue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.690" end="01:45.400"><span begin="01:31.690" end="01:32.080">There </span><span begin="01:32.080" end="01:32.140">are </span><span begin="01:32.140" end="01:32.530">no </span><span begin="01:32.530" end="01:34.030">crowds </span><span begin="01:34.030" end="01:34.330">in </span><span begin="01:34.330" end="01:34.840">the </span><span begin="01:34.840" end="01:36.820">streets </span><span begin="01:36.820" end="01:37.150">and </span><span begin="01:37.150" end="01:37.450">no </span><span begin="01:37.450" end="01:39.970">sun </span><span begin="01:39.970" end